OL,3,GNEWSAChild in 'stable condition' as
OL,4,Apolice continue murder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl is in a stable
OL,7,Fcondition in hospital and a 16-year-old
OL,8,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fmurder and attempted murder following
OL,10,Fan incident at a house in Dungannon on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,13,FThe body of a 61-year-old man was found
OL,14,Falongside his injured daughter at a
OL,15,Fproperty in Lisnahull Road at about
OL,16,F11:00 BST.
OL,18,FThe man's wife, 48, who sustained
OL,19,Fnon-life threatening injuries during
OL,20,Fthe incident, has been released from
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
