OL,3,GNEWSAChild in 'stable condition' as
OL,4,Apolice continue murder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed the teenager who
OL,7,Fwas arrested remains in custody and
OL,8,Fdetectives have been granted a court
OL,9,Fextension for a further 36 hours to
OL,10,Fquestion him.
